+  <nav class="side-nav"><button class="nav-item active" data-view="board"><span class="nav-icon">▦</span> My board</button><button class="nav-item" data-view="today"><span class="nav-icon">◷</span> Due today <span class="nav-count" id="todayCount">0</span></button><button class="nav-item" data-view="upcoming"><span class="nav-icon">▤</span> Upcoming</button><button class="nav-item" data-view="done"><span class="nav-icon">✓</span> Completed</button></nav>
+  <div class="side-bottom"><div class="side-tip"><div class="tip-icon">✳</div><strong>A little progress<br>goes a long way.</strong><p>Keep your focus on what matters today.</p></div><button id="backupBtn" class="nav-item"><span class="nav-icon">↥</span> Back up your board</button><div class="profile"><div class="avatar">Y</div><div><strong>Your space</strong><small>Personal workspace</small></div><span class="profile-dots">···</span></div></div>
+</aside>
+<main class="main-area">
+<header class="topbar"><div class="breadcrumb">Workspace <span>/</span> <b id="crumb">My board</b></div><div class="top-actions"><button class="help-btn" id="helpBtn">? <span>Help</span></button><button class="avatar top-avatar" aria-label="Profile">Y</button></div></header>
+<section class="content">
+<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow" id="dateLabel">YOUR PERSONAL SPACE</div><h1 id="pageTitle">My board <span class="title-spark">✳</span></h1><p id="pageSubtitle">A clear mind starts with a clear plan.</p></div><button class="primary-btn" id="newTaskBtn"><span>＋</span> Add a task</button></div>
+<div class="toolbar"><div class="view-tabs"><button class="tab active" data-layout="board">Board</button><button class="tab" data-layout="list">List</button></div><div class="toolbar-right"><label class="search-wrap"><span>⌕</span><input id="searchInput" type="search" placeholder="Search tasks..." aria-label="Search tasks"><kbd>⌘ K</kbd></label><button class="filter-btn" id="filterBtn">☷ <span>Filter</span><i id="filterDot"></i></button><button class="icon-btn" id="sortBtn" title="Sort tasks" aria-label="Sort tasks">↕</button></div></div>
+<div class="filter-panel hidden" id="filterPanel"><label>Priority<select id="priorityFilter"><option value="all">All priorities</option><option value="high">High</option><option value="medium">Medium</option><option value="low">Low</option></select></label><label>Label<select id="labelFilter"><option value="all">All labels</option></select></label><button class="text-btn" id="clearFilters">Clear filters</button></div>
+<div id="boardView" class="board-grid"></div><div id="listView" class="list-view hidden"></div>
+<div class="board-footer"><span><span class="save-dot"></span> Saved automatically</span><span id="taskSummary"></span></div>
+</section>
+</main>
+</div>
+<div class="modal-backdrop hidden" id="taskModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modalTitle"><form class="task-form" id="taskForm"><div class="modal-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">MAKE IT HAPPEN</div><h2 id="modalTitle">Add a task</h2></div><button type="button" class="icon-btn close-btn" id="closeModal" aria-label="Close">×</button></div><input type="hidden" id="taskId"><label class="field-label" for="taskTitle">Task name</label><input class="form-input title-input" id="taskTitle" maxlength="120" placeholder="What needs to get done?" required><label class="field-label" for="taskDescription">Notes <span>OPTIONAL</span></label><textarea class="form-input" id="taskDescription" rows="3" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Add a little context..."></textarea><div class="form-row"><label class="field-label">Status<select class="form-input" id="taskStatus"><option value="todo">To do</option><option value="doing">In progress</option><option value="done">Done</option></select></label><label class="field-label">Priority<select class="form-input" id="taskPriority"><option value="medium">Medium</option><option value="high">High</option><option value="low">Low</option></select></label></div><div class="form-row"><label class="field-label">Due date<input class="form-input" id="taskDue" type="date"></label><label class="field-label">Label<input class="form-input" id="taskLabel" maxlength="24" placeholder="e.g. Work"></label></div><div class="modal-actions"><button type="button" class="delete-btn hidden" id="deleteTask">Delete task</button><span class="spacer"></span><button type="button" class="secondary-btn" id="cancelModal">Cancel</button><button class="primary-btn" type="submit">Save task</button></div></form></div>
+<div class="toast" id="toast" role="status"></div>
+<input type="file" id="importFile" accept="application/json,.json" hidden>
+<script src="app.js"></script>
+</body></html>
